Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:47.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《终结者3：机器的觉醒》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来尚未发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future has not been written.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.06,0:02:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运要靠自己创造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no fate but what we mak e for ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我能相信这句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫约翰康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出生前他们就想杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to murder me before I was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在我十三岁那年也试过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was 13, they tried again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自未来的机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Machines from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼终结者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从小我妈就说大灾难即将来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my life, my mother told me the storm was coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最后审判日 - 康纳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Judgment Day. - Connor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类与机器的大战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beginning of a war between man and machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十亿人口一瞬间被消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three billion lives would vanish in an instant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:03:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将率领人类获得最后胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would lead what was left of the human race to ultimate victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一天还没来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹没有从空而降{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bombs fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑也没有控制世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computers didn't tak e control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们阻止了审判日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stopped Judgment Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该感到安全…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should feel safe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是却没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定彻底脱离社会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I live off the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电话 住址{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No phone, no address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人或东西找得到我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one and nothing can find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我断绝和过去的联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've erased all connections to the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我再努力…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as hard as I try…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也无法停止做梦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I can't erase my dreams…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的噩梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉重的未来压得我喘不过气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the weight of the future bearing down on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A future I don't want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我一直逃跑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I k eep running…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拚命地逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as fast as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,越远越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,（比佛利山庄）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我打119吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to call 911?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,（连线）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,（连接资料库）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,（洛城联合校区）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,（优先目标）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,银色凌志 请减速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, in the silver Lexus. Slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻减速停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down and pull over immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.15,0:08:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,（性感是什么？维多利亚的秘密）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你开多快吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, have you any idea how fast you were going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,行照和驾照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your license and registration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.75,0:09:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stupid thing's not working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 凯蒂 是爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Kate, it's your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又要放我鸽子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're blowing me off again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我这周末很想见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. You know how much I wanted to see you this weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是电脑出状况…- 我知道 你不能多说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're having computer problems…- I know, you can't talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,史考特很想见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Scott was really looking forward to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想多认识他 是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie. I wish I had more time to get to know him. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:10:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你在婚礼上一定会见到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. You're bound to run into him at the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我还不肯接受这事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I'm still in a state of denial about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也一样 - 嘿 凯蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not the only one. - Hey, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要我对他的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need me to pass judgment on this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向都很独立自主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done the right thing your whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来就没犯过错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't mak e a mistak e. You never do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是世上最幸运的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the luckiest father in the world, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不必替女儿担心害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had to be afraid for my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.65,0:10:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 带他来找我 我保证不会爽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I hate this. I gotta run. Come see me. I promise I won't cancel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 我爱你 - 我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Dad, I love you. - Love you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么状况？- 新的电脑病毒威力强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, what have we got? - This new computer virus is tricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它感染一半民间网路 以及次要军事电脑程式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's infected half the civilian Internet as well as secondary military apps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 薪俸 库存管理系统 - 主要防御系统呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Payroll, inventory. - Primary defence nets are still clean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前防火墙还很牢固{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far the firewalls are holding up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:11:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,五角大厦要我们用人工智慧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the Pentagon has proposed we use our Al to scan the infrastructure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫瞄系统核心并消灭病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search and destroy for any hint of the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像是用火箭炮打苍蝇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Tony, but that's like going after a fly with a bazooka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要几分钟时间就搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the connection's made, it should only be a few minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们会让一个电脑系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}During which we put everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制国防卫星和核弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the control of one computer system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是史上最聪明的电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most intelligent system ever conceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是宁愿让人来操控电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still prefer to keep humans in the loop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不能启用天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure Skynet's ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,（动物医院兽医专用镇静剂）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,（沙漠之星酒吧）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该走后门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to go around to the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.05,0:14:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,（不符合）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你走…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I said you're supposed to go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,（淑女之夜）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,（不适宜）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,（符合）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把衣服脱光 - 别这么猴急嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take off your clothes. - Patience, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭婊子 还没轮到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch. Wait your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脱光衣服 - 去跟我的手说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your clothes. - Talk to the hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,（准确）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,（吉姆汉堡）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临 你要点什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Jim's Burgers. Can I tak e your order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 荷西巴瑞拉？- 我就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jose Barrera? - Yeah, that's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,（荷西巴瑞拉 符合）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球网路突然中断…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Growing concern over widespread outages in the global digital network…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谣传出现一个超级病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have prompted rumours of a new computer super-virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 华尔街分析师…- 糟糕 我妈回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wall Street analysts are confident…- Shit! My mom's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把啤酒藏起来 拿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Hide the beer. Hide the beer. Here. Take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉莎白和威廉安德森？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth and William Anderson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威廉 我姐在楼上 有事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bill. My sister's upstairs. Is there something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有急事 我要到诊所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to the clinic. It's an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是凌晨四点半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 4:30 in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你起床前我就会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be back before you get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.39,0:18:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫了 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool it, guys, it's just me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一只病猫要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a sick cat coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸毒者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junkies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你别报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜上礼拜也是你干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it was you who ripped us off last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电话放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the phone down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一些药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed some medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,半里外有一家急诊医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an emergency clinic half a mile away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃了多少药？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much did you take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够多了 - 这是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enough. - Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来把公狗阉掉的药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is the stuff we use to chemically neuter dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我关起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! You didn't have to do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次学聪明点 别用漆弹枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time bring a clue, not a paintball gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是坏人 - 才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, this isn't what you think. - Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小黑得了肺炎他一直咳个不停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Hercules has got pneumonia. He started coughing and won't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诊所出了点问题 - 我的猫得了急病耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Betsy, I've got a problem in the back. - A problem? This is an emergency!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他听起来像是吞了毛球 - 我会不知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It sounds like a hairball. - I know what a hairball sounds like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孟医生呢？- 凌晨五点半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Dr. Monroe? - It's 5:30 in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在睡觉 有必要我会请他来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he's home sleeping. He'll come in if he has to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:21:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,带小黑进去等我几分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait in here with Hercules and I'll be a few minutes, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯麦克的地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike Kripke's basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.57,0:21:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是约翰康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凯蒂布斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Kate Brewster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是西丘国中同学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went to West Hills Junior High together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:22:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 你发生什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus. - What happened to you, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.63,0:22:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,国二那年你突然消失无踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle of eighth grade, you just disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的养父母又出事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was that thing about your foster parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们惨遭谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they were murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.73,0:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我杀的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有同伴吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is somebody with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.14,0:22:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯萨琳布斯特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine Brewster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.35,0:24:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,（分析遗传基因）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,（主要目标：约翰康纳）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰康纳来过 他去了哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor was here. Where did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.44,0:25:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 他去了哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. Where did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.98,0:25:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯萨琳布斯特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine Brewster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.19,0:25:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Let me down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.99,0:25:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把我放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me down! Let me down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.49,0:25:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰康纳呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is John Connor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.12,0:26:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了你就放我走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I tell you, will you let me go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.50,0:26:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.50,0:26:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我关在狗笼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the kennel, in a cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.93,0:26:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你要放我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you'd let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.97,0:26:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 你要放我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please. You have to let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.19,0:27:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.86,0:27:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.41,0:27:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来杀我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here to kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.00,0:27:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你要活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You must live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.89,0:27:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.23,0:27:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去哪儿？- 继续逃亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we going? - Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.48,0:27:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.90,0:27:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.45,0:28:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有脉搏 - 把他抬下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No pulse. - See if you can get him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.62,0:28:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他重得要命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy weighs a ton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.15,0:29:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 911 - 我被绑架了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 911. - Yes. Yes. I'm being kidnapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.61,0:29:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪里？- 不知道 在货车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you now? - I don't know where. I'm in my truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.49,0:29:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆丰田货车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Toyota Tundra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.16,0:29:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,车身有艾氏动物医院的名字 我被关在后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says " Emery Animal Hospital" on the side. I'm locked inside the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.50,0:29:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.67,0:29:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.97,0:29:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,（讯号中断）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.51,0:29:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,（遥控行车）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.62,0:30:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.43,0:31:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.89,0:31:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.52,0:31:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不都是你害的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me. You got me into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.52,0:31:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop the car. - I can't. Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.90,0:31:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混球 快停车 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You bastard! Stop the car! - Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.54,0:31:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.54,0:31:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.71,0:31:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你干的好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what you did to my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.88,0:31:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公司车耶 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my company car, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.34,0:31:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your ass out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.05,0:31:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上滚下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your ass out of the car. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.51,0:31:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.73,0:31:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没保险我就要海扁你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't have insurance, I'm gonna rip your balls off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.77,0:31:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想惹麻烦 - 闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want any problems, okay? - Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.27,0:31:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.57,0:32:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在后面？怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's talking back there? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.03,0:32:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静点 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down. - Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.28,0:32:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我被绑架了 快报警 - 正如我所料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm being kidnapped! Call the police! - Well, I'll be goddamned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.20,0:32:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快报警！- 哇塞 警察来得还真快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call 911! - A cop when you need one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.24,0:32:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放我出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, please! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.49,0:32:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放我出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.83,0:32:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我滚回来 混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here, asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.19,0:32:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是警察 你要停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the cops! You have to pull over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.61,0:32:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会停车才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, first chance I get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,（锁定目标）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.93,0:33:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.25,0:35:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.19,0:36:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.33,0:36:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.51,0:37:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.44,0:37:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,（目标距离）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.93,0:38:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.21,0:38:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有脑震荡的症状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of brain trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.05,0:38:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.06,0:38:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.52,0:38:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉康纳 赛博坦公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor? Blowing up Cyberdyne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.27,0:38:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,后会有期吧 宝贝 记得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hasta la vista, baby." Ring any bells?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.77,0:38:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是另一个魔鬼终结者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a different T-101.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.74,0:39:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是工厂制造的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you come off an assembly line or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.32,0:39:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.37,0:39:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又得重新教你一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. I'm gonna have to teach you everything all over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.41,0:39:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯萨琳布斯特 你有没有受伤？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine Brewster, have you sustained injury?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.08,0:39:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop dead, you asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.75,0:39:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕难从命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm unable to comply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.51,0:39:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要带我去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you taking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.43,0:39:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a safe location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.24,0:39:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个交流道放她走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get off at the next exit. Let her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.95,0:39:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我要保护凯萨琳布斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. Katherine Brewster must be protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.71,0:39:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是来找我的 - 他们找不到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought they were after me. - You could not be located.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.17,0:40:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,才派TX除掉你的手下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a T-X was sent back through time to eliminate your lieutenants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.76,0:40:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也会加入反抗军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's gonna be in the Resistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.77,0:40:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不该存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, you shouldn't even exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.19,0:40:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛博坦公司十年前被毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we took out Cyberdyne over 10 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.90,0:40:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们阻止了审判日 - 只是拖延时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We stopped Judgment Day. - You only postponed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.90,0:40:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,审判日一定会来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judgment Day is inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.58,0:40:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要切割工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I require a cutting tool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.54,0:40:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,握好方向盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.09,0:40:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 我身上有两枚氢电池{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I am powered by hydrogen fuel cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.85,0:40:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一枚受损{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My primary cell was damaged by a plasma attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.39,0:40:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,TX是战斗机器人 身上有电浆反应器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-X is designed for extreme combat, driven by a plasma reactor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.60,0:40:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,和多种武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and equipped with onboard weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.73,0:41:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its arsenal includes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.23,0:41:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米科技注射器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nanotechnological transjectors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.99,0:41:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么东东？- 她可以控制其它的机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meaning? - It can control other machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.91,0:41:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的外壳很坚固 足以承受任何攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its body chassis is heavily armoured and hardened to withstand attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.96,0:41:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是你能对付她 - 不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll find a way to destroy her. - Unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.79,0:41:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是过时的型号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an obsolete design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.88,0:41:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,TX更快 更强 更聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-X is faster, more powerful and more intelligent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.38,0:41:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是最有效的杀人机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a far more effective killing machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.51,0:41:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.51,0:41:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.31,0:41:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我会出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My presence in this timeline has been anticipated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.52,0:41:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,TX可以摧毁任何机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-X is designed to terminate other cybernetic organisms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.73,0:41:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是魔鬼终结者的终结者啰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's an anti-Terminator Terminator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.24,0:41:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吓唬我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be shitting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.07,0:41:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有吓唬你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am not shitting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,氢电池受损后非常不稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When ruptured, the fuel cells become unstable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.47,0:42:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.97,0:42:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放我出去 - 别叫了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me out of here! - Relax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.44,0:42:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,（24小时便利商店）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.28,0:42:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,（收讯中断）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.45,0:42:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,（请稍候）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.78,0:42:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,（电脑当机 恕不刷卡）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.46,0:42:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is wack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一台都收不到讯号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been like this for hours. Every goddamn station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.07,0:43:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.03,0:43:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你付不付钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Are you gonna pay for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.87,0:43:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去跟我的手说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to the hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.18,0:43:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 救命啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.47,0:43:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.85,0:43:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we better go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.01,0:44:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛肉干？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.47,0:44:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要绑架我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidnapping me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.68,0:44:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着…- 你一向都是问题少年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look…- God, you were always a delinquent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.23,0:44:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还以为耍坏这招很酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at you now, sitting there like the bad-boy thing still works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.31,0:44:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是古惑仔吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, some kind of gang member?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.36,0:44:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底有没有良心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you live with yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.99,0:44:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.04,0:44:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她说我是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.79,0:44:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰康纳是全球反抗军领袖…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor is leader of the Worldwide Resistance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.62,0:44:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是人类的救星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and last hope of humankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.05,0:44:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 他咧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.47,0:44:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是来自未来的机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a robot from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.05,0:44:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面是肌肤 里面是钢架 他回来保护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living tissue over a metal skeleton, sent back in time to protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.89,0:45:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.43,0:45:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你没有恶意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't mean you any harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.23,0:45:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有未婚夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a fiance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.48,0:45:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be looking for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.82,0:45:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it that you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.03,0:45:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.28,0:45:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…imagine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.58,0:45:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你知道你会做一件大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you knew you were gonna do something important with your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.91,0:45:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件惊天动地的大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.62,0:45:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许是史上最重要的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the most important thing anyone has ever done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.88,0:45:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.46,0:45:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会发生可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something terrible has to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.56,0:45:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.35,0:45:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着阻止它发生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…live with yourself if you didn't try to stop it, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.48,0:45:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.69,0:45:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这一辈子过的生活…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…The life you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.28,0:45:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你视为理所当然的一切…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all the stuff that you take for granted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.32,0:46:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会永远存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's not gonna last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.42,0:46:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike Kripke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.13,0:46:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么说柯麦克的地下室？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there, why did you say "Kripke's basement"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.80,0:46:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Mike Kripke's house…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.55,0:46:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,青少年都到柯麦克家亲热 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that's where the kids used to go make out, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.26,0:46:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我 我们有没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and me…Wait, did we…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.81,0:46:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇靠 我们有耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit, we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.44,0:46:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们亲热过 你竟然会记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made out in Kripke's basement. I cannot believe you remembered that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.19,0:46:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是煞到我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have made some kind of impression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.66,0:46:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别臭美了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.37,0:46:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔天你就上新闻我才会记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only remembered because the next day you were in the news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.08,0:46:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我遇到他前一天跟你在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. You and me hooked up the day before I first met him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.05,0:47:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了十年后又在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now again, 10 years later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.89,0:47:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我们注定要见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.68,0:47:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是巧合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.81,0:47:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.01,0:47:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是刚回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey? Did you just get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.11,0:48:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是艾警探 这是贝警探{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Detective Edwards, L.A.P.D. This is Detective Bell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.12,0:48:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯萨琳布斯特在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for Katherine Brewster. Is she here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.91,0:48:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.29,0:48:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是她未婚夫史考特？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're her fiance Scott Mason? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.83,0:48:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她工作的动物医院出了事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an incident at the veterinary hospital where she works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.88,0:48:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能身陷危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're concerned something may have happened to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.76,0:48:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.18,0:48:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,魏特谷加油站员工报案说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a report from a gas station attendant near Victorville…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.72,0:48:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他目睹绑票案 这可能有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about a possible kidnapping and it might be related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.81,0:48:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你找到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.11,0:48:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.37,0:48:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.86,0:49:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.99,0:49:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她葬在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never even knew where she was buried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.87,0:49:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一死我就逃亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit the road the day she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.13,0:49:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,（莎拉康纳 1959-1997 命运要靠自己创造）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.58,0:49:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么带我来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you bring me here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.88,0:49:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.51,0:49:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.26,0:49:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手拿开！住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from it! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.27,0:49:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉康纳在墨西哥火化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor was cremated in Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.02,0:50:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的骨灰被撒在大海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her friends scattered her ashes in the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.69,0:50:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的遗愿是把武器藏在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stored these weapons in accordance with her will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.40,0:50:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么死的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.53,0:50:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,血癌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leukaemia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.29,0:50:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.87,0:50:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发病时我们人在巴哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were living in Baja when she was diagnosed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.05,0:50:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生说她只能活半年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only gave her six months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.76,0:50:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她却撑了三年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she fought for three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.30,0:50:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要确定一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to make sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.43,0:50:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.06,0:50:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日没有来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the world didn't end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.78,0:50:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说：「之后的每一天都很宝贵」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}" Every day after this one is a gift."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.99,0:50:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们成功了 我们自由了」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me, "We made it. We're free."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.70,0:51:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我一直都不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never really believed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.38,0:51:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜她也不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess she didn't either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.59,0:51:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一生只能把你当成父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you were about the closest thing to a father I ever had?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.47,0:51:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可怜吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How pathetic is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.81,0:51:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.39,0:51:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务是保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mission is to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.27,0:51:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.15,0:51:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我会向你开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move or I'll do it! I swear I will! I'll shoot you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.45,0:51:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开了枪就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. See what happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.67,0:51:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别向我开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.38,0:51:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.56,0:52:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是警察 你们被包围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the police. We have the building surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.10,0:52:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把人质放走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release your hostage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.17,0:52:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我 你找的不是我 你在浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me here. I'm not the one you want. You're wasting your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.09,0:52:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 约翰康纳率领反抗军获得胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incorrect. John Connor leads the Resistance to victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.34,0:52:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.76,0:52:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.80,0:52:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是约翰康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.22,0:52:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就被我妈灌输这种屁话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, my mom fed me that bullshit since the cradle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.77,0:52:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 我不是什么领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. I'm no leader, I never was!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.69,0:52:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后也不会是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.78,0:52:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.65,0:52:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对 我找的不是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. You're not the one I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.78,0:52:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wasting my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.99,0:53:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 你这臭机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, you fucking machine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.25,0:53:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.00,0:53:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才在耍我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you were just dicking with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.26,0:53:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒比绝望更有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anger is more useful than despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.13,0:53:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.89,0:53:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的副程式包括人类心理学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basic psychology is among my subroutines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.60,0:53:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没抓到嫌犯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perps still holed up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.77,0:53:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.06,0:53:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 你未婚妻没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news. Your fiance's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.78,0:53:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.03,0:53:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿茵墓园 五号公路旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greenlawn Cemetery, up off the 5 freeway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.74,0:53:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在沙漠旁边 他们要带她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right by the desert. But they're gonna bring her back to the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.62,0:53:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Oh, my dear Jesus! God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.48,0:54:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全了 不会受伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe now. They can't hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.49,0:54:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂 我是西伯曼医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, my name is Dr. Silberman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.82,0:54:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警方的创伤后心理顾问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a post-trauma counsellor for the sheriff's department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.33,0:54:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.16,0:54:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.50,0:54:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的 不是人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's really not human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.09,0:54:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道被挟持为人质的感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like to be in a hostage situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.72,0:54:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也当过人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been there myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.97,0:54:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,极度恐惧 心跳加速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fear, the adrenaline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.27,0:54:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会让人产生各种幻觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find yourself imagining things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.69,0:54:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能发生的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.98,0:54:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.44,0:54:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人抓狂的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insane things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.66,0:55:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年后才能复元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take years to get over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.74,0:55:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上！上！- 进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go! - Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.88,0:55:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.92,0:55:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那具棺材！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the coffin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.26,0:55:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him down! Take him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.99,0:56:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,（发射760枚子弹 17辆车被毁）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.75,0:56:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,（无人伤亡）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.72,0:56:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resume fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.81,0:56:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到凯萨琳布斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must reacquire Katherine Brewster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.98,0:56:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么这么重要？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What makes her so goddamn important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.11,0:56:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要透过她联络美国军方…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through her, you contact remnants of the military…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.11,0:56:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,学会如何对抗天网系统 并组成反抗军核心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and learn how to fight Skynet, forming the core of the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.29,0:56:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的小孩也会很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, your children will become important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.79,0:56:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 她是你的妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - She's your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.68,0:57:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.56,0:57:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想死就快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to live? Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.46,0:58:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是史考特 怎么可能？- 你的未婚夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was Scott! How could it be Scott? - Your fiance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.01,0:58:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,TX能化身为任何形体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-X is polymimetic, able to take the form of anything it touches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.76,0:58:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的未婚夫死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fiance is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.37,0:58:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.08,0:58:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.28,0:59:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.47,0:59:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一辆新车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a new vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.05,0:59:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,（主要武器损毁）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.69,0:59:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,（寻找替代品）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.55,0:59:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,（选择替代武器）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.64,1:01:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别哭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.35,1:01:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要逃下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.65,1:01:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她因为我杀了史考特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed Scott because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.95,1:01:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这么说没什么用…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know this won't help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.50,1:01:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有时候我们无法改变事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but sometimes things happen that we just can't change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.05,1:01:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.02,1:01:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.07,1:01:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我跟她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About her and me, I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.69,1:01:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的问题没有道理 她是正值繁殖期的健康女性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your confusion is not rational. She's a healthy female of breeding age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.49,1:02:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当夫妻不是这么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to it than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.53,1:02:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有人类两性关系的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My database does not encompass the dynamics of human pair bonding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.63,1:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,女魔鬼终结者要杀多少人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this Terminatrix, how many others does she have on her hit list?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.80,1:02:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,22人 伊莉莎白和威廉安德森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-two. Anderson, Elizabeth. Anderson, William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.63,1:02:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷西巴瑞拉 劳勃布斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barrera, Jose. Brewster, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.55,1:02:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.97,1:02:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然她没除掉主要目标…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having failed to acquire its primary target…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.81,1:02:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会寻找次要目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…T- X will resume its default program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.19,1:02:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她也要去杀我爸？- 很有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's gonna kill my father too? - There's a high probability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.98,1:02:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 他是做什么的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Who is he? What does he do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.53,1:02:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在空军负责秘密武器系统 我也不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the Air Force. Weapon design, secret stuff. I don't know, exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.20,1:02:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳勃布斯特负责制造CRS…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Robert Brewster is program director of CRS…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.16,1:02:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是电脑研究系统 自主性武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Cyber Research Systems, autonomous weapons division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.25,1:02:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网 你说的是天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet. You're talking about Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.33,1:02:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网是他负责的一种防御系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet is one of the digital defence systems developed under Brewster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.80,1:02:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.67,1:02:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.30,1:03:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all makes sense now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.64,1:03:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你当年没回来改变一切…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hadn't come back when I was a kid, changed everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.18,1:03:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会跟她在一起 也会认识她父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we would have gotten together then. I would have met her father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.69,1:03:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不懂吗？- 我不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you see? - I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.27,1:03:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都跟你爸有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father. This is all about your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.36,1:03:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都是关键人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the key. He always was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.20,1:03:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸才能摧毁天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father is the one who can shut Skynet down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.37,1:03:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他才办得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one who ever could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.75,1:03:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在TX之前找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to him before the T-X does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.08,1:03:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不能违反任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. I cannot jeopardize my mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.67,1:03:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务是拯救人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your mission, to save people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.80,1:03:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务是保护你跟她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mission is to ensure the survival of John Connor and Katherine Brewster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.51,1:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要命令你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am giving you an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.97,1:03:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不必服从你的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not programmed to follow your orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.72,1:03:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 核战爆发后…- 核战？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After the nuclear war, you both…- Nuclear war?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.98,1:03:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有核战 我们能阻止它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There doesn't have to be a war! We can stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.23,1:03:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is insufficient time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.56,1:03:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一枚核弹于6时18分发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first launch sequences will be initiated at 6: 18 p.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.90,1:03:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天吗？- 正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, today? - Affirmative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.86,1:04:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, what is he saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.70,1:04:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,审判日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judgment Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.08,1:04:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.62,1:04:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个小时后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's today, three hours from now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.08,1:04:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,2小时53分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hours and 53 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.25,1:04:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要到墨西哥躲避核爆威力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must continue south into Mexico to escape the primary blast zones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.09,1:04:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们要去找她爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we have to get to her dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.55,1:04:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,核爆后摩哈比沙漠首当其冲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mojave area will sustain significant nuclear fallout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.60,1:04:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.10,1:04:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我躲起来让核战爆发？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean we go hide somewhere in a hole while the bombs fall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.27,1:04:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.45,1:04:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去我的命运 - 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck my destiny. - John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.20,1:04:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能自我终结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot self-terminate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.58,1:04:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能 我想怎样都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't. I can do whatever I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.17,1:04:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是人 不是机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a human being. I'm not some goddamn robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.13,1:04:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是一个电脑有机体 - 随便啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cybernetic organism. - Whatever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.13,1:05:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能劝她爸摧毁天网…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either we get her father to shut Skynet down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.13,1:05:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止核战发生 伟大的约翰康纳也不必活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…stop this shit from ever happening, or so much for the great John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.60,1:05:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我从来都不想要这种命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because your future, my destiny, I don't want any part of it. I never did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.60,1:05:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你的瞳孔大小和体温…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on your pupil dilation, skin temperature and motor functions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.02,1:05:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有八成三的可能不会扣扳机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I calculate an 83? probability that you will not pull the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.99,1:05:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他的话 你一定要救我爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do what he says. You have to save my father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.50,1:05:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计一小时后可以抵达…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can reach CRS in approximately one hour…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.21,1:05:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看交通状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…depending on traffic conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.36,1:06:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get a line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.08,1:06:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全收不到讯号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole cell network is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.08,1:06:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网控制全球通讯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet is assuming control over global communications…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.21,1:06:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发动攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in preparation for its attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.71,1:06:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场人类与机器的战争…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if this war is between people and machines…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.17,1:06:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何站在我们这边？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why are you on our side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.55,1:06:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗军抓到我 改写我的程式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Resistance captured me and reprogrammed my CPU.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.68,1:06:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原来负责刺杀行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was originally designed for assassination missions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.10,1:06:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.98,1:06:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在乎这项任务成功或失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you don't really care if this mission succeeds or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.40,1:06:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死了对你有什么影响？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get killed, does that mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.57,1:06:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们死了我就失去功用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were to die, I will become useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.99,1:06:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有存在的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no reason for me to exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.75,1:07:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.00,1:07:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必谢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gratitude is not required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.71,1:07:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须服从你的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am programmed to follow your commands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.09,1:07:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的命令？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her commands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.68,1:07:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她改写我的程式…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine Brewster had me reactivated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.64,1:07:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,派我回到过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and sent through the time displacement field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.22,1:07:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在未来扮演什么角色？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly am I in this future of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.02,1:07:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是约翰的妻子和副指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're John Connor's spouse and second-in-command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.69,1:07:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.49,1:07:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.74,1:07:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你糟透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.95,1:07:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不是我喜欢的那一型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're not exactly my type, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.75,1:07:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么不派你来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I send you back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.96,1:07:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能回答你的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not authorized to answer your question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.00,1:07:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他为什么没派你来？- 他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't he send you back? - He was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.10,1:07:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,衰毙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.72,1:07:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人都难逃一死 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Humans inevitably die. - Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.52,1:08:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么…算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how does it… No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.11,1:08:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我不想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I don't want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.48,1:08:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么死的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.70,1:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在2032年7月4日遇害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor was terminated on July 4th, 2032.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.66,1:08:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他小时候被我这种型号救过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was selected for the emotional attachment he had for my model…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.70,1:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他对我有感情 这对我的任务有帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…due to his boyhood experiences. This aided in my infiltration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.96,1:08:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.34,1:08:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.98,1:08:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定搞错了 主要军事系统都没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to be a mistake. As of 1100, all military systems were secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.15,1:08:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有民间系统受病毒感染 网路 飞航局和发电厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were. Only the civilian sector was affected. Internet, air traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.36,1:08:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在空军基地也这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minutes ago, guidance computers at Vandenberg crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.36,1:08:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是病毒搞的鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it was an error. It looks like the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.20,1:08:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉斯加预警系统也失效 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early warning in Alaska is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.51,1:09:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防卫星讯号受到干扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite signals are scrambled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.66,1:09:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞弹基地和核子潜艇呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the missile silos, the subs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.54,1:09:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.21,1:09:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我们毫无防御力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying this country is completely open to attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.84,1:09:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上我们可能正遭到攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically, we could be under attack already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.84,1:09:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁干的？敌国或是电脑骇客？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's doing this? A foreign power or some computer hacker in his garage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.43,1:09:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追踪不到病毒来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't trace the virus or pin it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.73,1:09:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好像有意识 一直在成长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps growing and changing, like it has a mind of its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.40,1:09:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.36,1:09:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,参谋总长从五角大厦来电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pentagon's on the secure line. It's the chairman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.82,1:09:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.17,1:09:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.42,1:09:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都不会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…none of this is gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.01,1:10:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到你爸 请他摧毁天网 核战就不会爆发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to your dad, get him to pull the plug on Skynet. The bombs won't fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.77,1:10:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以后也不必杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't have to kill me someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.40,1:10:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本不会存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never even exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.40,1:10:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你从此分道扬镳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I, we can just go our separate ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.45,1:10:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 柯麦克的地下室…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mike Kripke's basement…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.79,1:10:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的初吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the first time I ever kissed a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.96,1:10:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.51,1:10:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,男女调情是件好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your levity is good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.31,1:10:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,能消除紧张情绪和恐惧感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It relieves tension and the fear of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.92,1:11:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望你有解决方案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hoping you have a solution for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.72,1:11:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网还不能进行系统连线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, sir, but Skynet is not ready for a system- wide connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.68,1:11:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,民间包商可不是这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what your civilian counterparts there told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.81,1:11:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我们可以消灭病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say we can stop this damn virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.27,1:11:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你怕表现不好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand there's a certain amount of performance anxiety…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.94,1:11:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你的手下说只要启动天网…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but your boys say if we plug Skynet into all of our systems…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.44,1:11:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能杀死病毒 让我控制军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it'll squash this thing and give me back control of my military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.69,1:11:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman, I need to make myself very clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.36,1:11:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网一连线就会控制军方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we uplink now, Skynet will be in control of your military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.95,1:11:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你能控制天网 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll be in control of Skynet, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.33,1:11:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.62,1:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.17,1:11:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事一旦成功…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Brewster, if this thing works…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.09,1:11:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就有用不完的资金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'll get all the funding you'll ever need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.38,1:12:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.44,1:12:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,（连线）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.61,1:13:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,（执行 是/否？）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.95,1:13:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.79,1:13:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.13,1:13:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.80,1:13:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.48,1:13:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天网防御系统启动 - 我们进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Skynet Defence System activated. - We're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.65,1:13:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过防火墙 进入防御系统和潜舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're past the firewalls, local defence nets, Minutemen, subs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.07,1:13:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网以每秒六十兆次浮点运算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet's fully operational, processing at 60 teraflops a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.37,1:13:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在一分钟内就能杀死病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should take less than a minute to find the virus and kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.33,1:13:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷上帝它有效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pray to God this works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.46,1:14:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,停电吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power failure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.80,1:14:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.19,1:14:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.77,1:14:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.36,1:14:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂 你跑来干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.24,1:14:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 快躲开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy! Get away from it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.87,1:14:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.64,1:14:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.90,1:15:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.27,1:15:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要关掉天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to shut down Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.44,1:15:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的系统核心在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the system core? In this building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.24,1:15:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网被电脑病毒感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet. The virus has infected Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.24,1:15:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网就是病毒 它控制了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet is the virus! It's why everything's falling apart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.54,1:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网产生自觉性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet has become self-aware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.83,1:15:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后就会向敌人发射核弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In one hour it will initiate a massive nuclear attack on its enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.63,1:15:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么敌人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What enemy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.34,1:15:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.92,1:15:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.35,1:15:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 机器开始反扑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! It's the machines. They're starting to take over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.77,1:15:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要到我的办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My office, on this floor, we have to get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.44,1:15:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码在我的保险柜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The access codes are in my safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.48,1:17:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们为什么滥杀人类？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they killing everyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.31,1:17:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了消灭对所有天网潜在的威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To destroy any threat to Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.73,1:17:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which ones are the codes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.69,1:17:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色信封{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red envelope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.32,1:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定要赶到水晶峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crystal Peak. You have to get to Crystal Peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.33,1:17:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在说什么？- 水晶峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is he saying? - Crystal Peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.66,1:17:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,位于内华达山脉的堡垒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hardened facility in the Sierra Nevada mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.50,1:17:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,方位015度 东北52英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-two miles northeast, bearing 0.5 degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.42,1:17:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统核心在那儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the system core?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.71,1:17:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是唯一的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your only chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.01,1:17:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要一架飞机 顺着粒子加速器就会到跑道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need a plane. The particle accelerator leads to the runway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.97,1:17:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照顾我女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.14,1:17:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Katie, I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.73,1:17:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打开了潘朵拉魔盒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I opened Pandora's box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.15,1:17:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.59,1:18:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也救不了他 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you can do. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.13,1:18:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快走 这里不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must go. It is not safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.01,1:18:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, we have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.64,1:18:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要你跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate! He wanted you to come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.60,1:18:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我们摧毁天网 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted us to shut Skynet down. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.48,1:18:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.91,1:18:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.17,1:20:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.12,1:21:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿 跟着走就会到跑道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. We can follow it out to the runway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.16,1:21:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.76,1:22:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.10,1:22:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.85,1:22:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我想起我妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.41,1:22:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 她追来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. She's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.46,1:23:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.38,1:23:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动加速器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powering up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.64,1:23:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.86,1:23:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,（5.76兆瓦特）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.00,1:23:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,（启动电磁场）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.38,1:24:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.38,1:24:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 贱货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just die, you bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.68,1:24:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.59,1:25:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸的飞机 我会开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's my father's plane. I trained on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.44,1:26:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 他赶来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! He made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.65,1:26:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.11,1:26:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.91,1:26:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.45,1:26:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.58,1:26:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主开关 油门杆 - 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The master's on. Throttle's set. - Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.72,1:26:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 你不能杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. You can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.93,1:26:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.43,1:26:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,TX…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-X…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.10,1:26:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵入我的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has corrupted my system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.11,1:26:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过 你不能杀害人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill a human being. You said so yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.32,1:26:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.14,1:26:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,（主要目标）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.82,1:27:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以抗拒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fighting it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.49,1:27:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的中央处理器很完整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My CPU is intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.16,1:27:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我无法控制其它功能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot control my other functions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.13,1:27:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必杀我 你不想杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this. You don't want to do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.30,1:27:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟我的想法无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desire is irrelevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.47,1:27:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.65,1:27:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.03,1:27:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护约翰康纳和…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ensure the survival of John Connor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.78,1:27:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯萨琳布斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Katherine Brewster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.17,1:27:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务就要失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are about to fail that mission!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.22,1:28:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can…I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.14,1:28:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.23,1:28:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.02,1:28:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,（执行 放弃）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.44,1:28:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.29,1:28:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,（指令无效）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.32,1:28:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.03,1:29:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下不了手 把自己关掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't do it. He shut himself down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.41,1:29:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能开吗？- 可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you fly? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.40,1:29:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,015度…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. 015 degrees…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.78,1:29:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,52英里 最高时速160英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…52 miles, our max air speed is about 160.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.16,1:29:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩32分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got 32 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.74,1:29:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just you and me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.74,1:29:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不成功呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we can't stop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.79,1:29:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些炸药能毁灭十台超级电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's enough C-4 here to take out 10 supercomputers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.88,1:29:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定会成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it, Kate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.42,1:30:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的未来都靠我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future is up to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.22,1:30:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.08,1:30:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,（重新启动）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.07,1:30:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,（危险）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.33,1:30:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,（军事要地 禁止进入）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.62,1:31:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网 也许还有机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet. There may be more of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.56,1:31:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.57,1:31:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一道防爆门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is some kind of blast door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.91,1:31:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也炸不进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we can blow through this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.79,1:32:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.80,1:32:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.02,1:32:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,（蓝478）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.09,1:32:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是密码提示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a code prompt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.56,1:32:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入达科塔775{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Type in " Dakota 775."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.03,1:32:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,（开启电源）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.78,1:32:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,红176{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Red 176."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.13,1:32:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把门打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We gotta get this thing open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.72,1:32:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 是「亚维隆412」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. It's "Avalon 412."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.47,1:32:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快输入呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.50,1:32:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,（准许进入）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.17,1:33:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.11,1:33:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.86,1:33:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,（失败）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.04,1:34:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.75,1:34:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.90,1:34:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 我们会再见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - We'll meet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.49,1:34:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.78,1:34:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.41,1:35:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被终结了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are terminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.15,1:35:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭电梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.08,1:36:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设定五分钟后引爆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll set the detonator for five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.00,1:36:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间足够让我们上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should give us enough time to get back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.78,1:36:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.16,1:37:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,（美国总统）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.24,1:37:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是三十年前的电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These computers are 30 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.25,1:37:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.76,1:37:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.76,1:37:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是政府官员的避难所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a fallout shelter for VIPs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.44,1:37:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是他们没得到任何预警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only they never got the warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.44,1:38:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.45,1:38:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.47,1:38:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么不说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he tell us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.64,1:38:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么带我们来这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he lead us down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.81,1:38:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.65,1:38:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was his mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.50,1:38:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就阻止不了核战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was never any stopping it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.34,1:39:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.01,1:39:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we could just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.51,1:39:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.68,1:39:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.81,1:39:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Can somebody hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.10,1:39:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是蒙大拿州民防队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Montana Civil Defence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.52,1:39:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody please come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.19,1:39:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.20,1:39:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone reading me? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.37,1:39:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说发生核战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumours about a launch sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.37,1:39:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是指挥部完全失联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command and control have brok en down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.87,1:39:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到吗？有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone receiving me? Somebody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.04,1:39:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody please come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.46,1:39:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.05,1:39:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空军司令部遭到攻击 - 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- SAC Nellis. We're under attack. - CQ? CQ?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.63,1:39:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.22,1:39:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是水晶峰的约翰康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Connor at Crystal Peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.81,1:40:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事？谁是那里的指挥官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor? What the hell is happening? Who's in charge there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.40,1:40:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.07,1:40:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮助我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, can you help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.74,1:40:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是蒙大拿州民防队 你说你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Montana Civil Defence. Where did you say you were again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.92,1:40:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网产生自觉性之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time Skynet became self-aware…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.09,1:40:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻侵入全球数百万台电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it had spread into millions of computer servers across the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.18,1:40:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公室 宿舍…无所不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ordinary computers in office buildings, dorm rooms, everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.93,1:40:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它存在于软体和网路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was software in cyberspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.77,1:40:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有系统核心 所以无法关闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no system core. It could not be shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.94,1:40:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,午后6时18分展开攻击 就跟他说的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The attack began at 6:18 p.m., just as he said it would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.95,1:40:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,审判日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judgment Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.45,1:40:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类几乎被保护自己的武器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day the human race was nearly destroyed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.12,1:41:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by weapons they'd built to protect themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.46,1:41:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该知道 我们不能阻止这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have realized our destiny was never to stop Judgment Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.47,1:41:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是要一起…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was merely to survive it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.64,1:41:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.14,1:41:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼终结者早就知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Terminator knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.48,1:41:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试着告诉我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to tell us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.81,1:41:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不想听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I didn't want to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.82,1:41:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许未来已经发生 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the future has been written. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.82,1:41:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道魔鬼终结者教导我：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is what the Terminator taught me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.16,1:41:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「永远不要停止奋战」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never stop fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.66,1:41:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会放弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.33,1:41:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争才刚开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The battle has just begun.{\r}
